      47.85,
      427.09,
      539.91,
      474.16
    ],
    "text": "The public is hereby informed that in terms of Section 37 of the Finance Business Act, No. 42 of 2011, theMonetary Board of the Central Bank of Sri Lanka, has decided to cancel the licence issued to Central Investments andFinance PLC under the said Finance Business Act with effect from 5th March 2018. Accordingly, Central Investementsand Finance PLC is not permitted to carry on finance business with effect from such date.",
